LAST-MODIFIED:20260827T183137Z
UID:10003537-1788688800-1788692400@uuasheville.org
SUMMARY:Sunday Worship Service: Water Communion & Picnic - OFF SITE!
DESCRIPTION:This service will be: \n\n\n\nheld off-site\, but it’s just up the road! (E.W. Grove Park is about 1 block north of UU AVL along Charlotte Street: 338 Charlotte Street Asheville\, NC 28804)\nour annual Water Communion\, so don’t forget your water bottle/vial/canteen!\nwhen we welcome our new Faith Formation and Justice Lead\, Dr. Matt Farris (Haelan)!\nthe last Single Service Sunday of summer! Service begins at 10 AM.\nnot be Livestreamed. Sorry!\n\n\n\nDon’t forget: a chair or blanket to sit on · a dish to share · a hat\, sunscreen\, or an umbrella for shade · your water to add to the water communion!
URL:https://uuasheville.org/event/sunday-worship-service-summer-schedule-3-2026-09-06/
LOCATION:E.W. Grove Park\, 338 Charlotte Street\, ASHEVILLE\, NC\, 28804\, United States
CATEGORIES:**Worship - LITURGY
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://uuasheville.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Water-Communion-Announcement-with-Matt.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Rev. Audette Fulbright Fulson":MAILTO:RevAudette@UUAsheville.org
END:VEVENT
